}]},{"id":163777652,"discussion_id":"a9971d6b2261e9a1a430c5ae2dbab40cacf5ad65","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在解决GatherV2算子内核在处理16位整数（int16_t）数据类型时，因缺少对应的SIMD（单指令多数据）最后聚集（Last Gather）处理路径而导致的功能缺失或执行错误问题。通过此修改，完善了算子对不同数据类型的支持能力。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案是在GatherV2算子的内核分发逻辑中，新增一个条件编译分支。当内核的Tiling Key匹配到预定义的`SIMD_LAST_GATHER_B16_TILING_KEY`时，将调用`Gatherv2SimdLastGather`模板类并指定数据类型为`int16_t`，从而实现对16位整数的SIMD最后聚集操作。此修改与现有对8位、32位和64位数据类型的支持逻辑保持一致，确保了代码结构的统一性和功能的完整性。","created_at":"2026-02-27T17:27:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-27T17:27:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163863315,"discussion_id":"7459fbf4927830800be8fb9f8239d508c04b902a","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n xiaodong666, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-28T14:29:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T14:29:31+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163863318,"discussion_id":"e0b7afa189cb93b900fbaeed4fe5d91dd823e641","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-28T14:29:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T14:29:31+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=17556